## Harmonics - The Game Changer

### Traditional Magic World

**Biological limitations:**
- A human/elven/orcish throat can only produce limited frequencies simultaneously
- Complex spells required **multiple casters** working in harmony
- Each caster holds one "note" in the harmonic structure
- Rituals = coordinated multi-frequency casting
- Very powerful magic required circles, covens, coordinated groups

### Post-Rift Technology Integration

**Technology breaks the biological limit:**
- Synthesizers can layer unlimited frequencies
- Recordings can play back complex harmonics
- A single device can replicate what required a ritual circle
- Even multiple kazoos in harmony can achieve complex effects

**This means:**
- One tech-savvy caster = what used to take a coven
- Spells can be recorded and replayed
- Mass production of magical effects becomes possible
- Magical "apps" and devices proliferate

**Fantasy casters' reaction:**
- Amazement at the efficiency
- Horror at the "cheapening" of the sacred art
- Fear of being made obsolete
- Some embrace it, others reject it violently

