## Post-Rift Changes

### How Magic Changed

**In the merged reality:**
- Magic becomes more reliable but less flexible
- More "programmatic" in behavior
- Easier to learn systematically
- Old masters worry the art is dying
- Young casters learn faster through tech-assisted methods

### How Technology Changed

**In the merged reality:**
- Machines develop preferences and quirks
- Electronics work better/worse for certain people
- Code can include lines no one wrote
- Certain algorithms produce magical effects when executed
- Scale-based disruption affects large systems

